# The about pages' lockup. It is NOT under chrome/app/theme at all -- version_ui.cc resolves
# IDR_PRODUCT_LOGO through components/resources/version_ui_scaled_resources.grdp, so the logo and
# wordmark on chrome://version come from this second tree. Replacing only chrome/app/theme leaves a
# Chromium circle and the word "chromium" on the one page users open to check what they are running.
